{"id":"585666622","kind":"article","title":"从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（简化版）","author":"Refold","original_authors":["Refold"],"original_source_urls":["https://refold.la/simplified/","https://refold.la/roadmap"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"外语习得","date":"2022-11-24","updated":"2024-01-20","votes":441,"comment_count":31,"minutes":1,"chars":577,"keywords":["Refold","二语习得","沉浸式学习","语言学习阶段","词汇","口语练习"],"summary":"Refold 简化路线图将语言学习分为打基础、沉浸理解和发展口语等阶段，概述各阶段目标与子主题，并链接详细版路线图。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/585666622","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"阶段 0：Refold 概述"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"A：了解方法"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"阶段 1：学会基础"},{"id":"sec-4","level":3,"title":"A：准备工具和建立习惯"},{"id":"sec-5","level":2,"title":"阶段 2：学会理解"},{"id":"sec-6","level":3,"title":"A：克服困难"},{"id":"sec-7","level":3,"title":"B：提高难度"},{"id":"sec-8","level":3,"title":"C：掌握领域"},{"id":"sec-9","level":2,"title":"阶段 3：学会口语"},{"id":"sec-10","level":3,"title":"A：准备输出"},{"id":"sec-11","level":3,"title":"B：学习写作"},{"id":"sec-12","level":3,"title":"C：学习口语"},{"id":"sec-13","level":2,"title":"阶段 4：超越流利"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"sec-1\">阶段 0：Refold 概述</h2><p data-pid=\"4tc9kmgl\">在开始语言学习之旅前，你需要做好准备。本节将带你了解在整个语言学习过程中将会用到的方法、思想和工具。</p><h3 id=\"sec-2\">A：了解方法</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"xYapxPNx\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"563595807\" href=\"#/post/563595807\">0A：什么是沉浸式语言学习？</a></li><li data-pid=\"oN8c0Bw8\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"564167912\" href=\"#/post/564167912\">0A：语言学习的三种方式</a></li><li data-pid=\"y_Kjqanv\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"564635314\" href=\"#/post/564635314\">0A：我目前处于哪一阶段？</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-3\">阶段 1：学会基础</h2><p data-pid=\"VdX_Ow73\">为沉浸式语言学习建立技能、工具和习惯，并通过学习你目标外语的基本语法和词汇来启动你的理解。</p><h3 id=\"sec-4\">A：准备工具和建立习惯</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"pnkyQSwW\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"565389270\" href=\"#/post/565389270\">1A：沉浸学习</a></li><li data-pid=\"49dTfZKi\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"565583093\" href=\"#/post/565583093\">1A：打下外语基础</a></li><li data-pid=\"C6voGOrP\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"565801338\" href=\"#/post/565801338\">1A：背单词</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-5\">阶段 2：学会理解</h2><p data-pid=\"vuZRbUPm\">直接在沉浸中学习，直到你完全理解。</p><h3 id=\"sec-6\">A：克服困难</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"mlVpXGJp\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"566431464\" href=\"#/post/566431464\">2A：精细沉浸</a></li><li data-pid=\"2Js06_ki\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"566658094\" href=\"#/post/566658094\">2A：词句挖掘</a></li><li data-pid=\"JXDolBnR\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"567218773\" href=\"#/post/567218773\">2A：衡量理解能力</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-7\">B：提高难度</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"YK_BAmCO\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"567740543\" href=\"#/post/567740543\">2B：沉浸学习指南</a></li><li data-pid=\"sj20aAew\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"568236210\" href=\"#/post/568236210\">2B：阅读</a></li><li data-pid=\"M82uwfSp\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"568506042\" href=\"#/post/568506042\">2B：转向单语词典</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-8\">C：掌握领域</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"jrcV7XeM\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"570304700\" href=\"#/post/570304700\">2C：专注主题</a></li><li data-pid=\"FLsujaf8\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"572241126\" href=\"#/post/572241126\">2C：掌握一个领域</a></li><li data-pid=\"MbFbBMya\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"572600379\" href=\"#/post/572600379\">2C：沉浸学习指南</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-9\">阶段 3：学会口语</h2><p data-pid=\"Ae8fNFgb\">把你习得的语言转化为口语能力。</p><h3 id=\"sec-10\">A：准备输出</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"2MQovVpv\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"577958313\" href=\"#/post/577958313\">3A：开始写作</a></li><li data-pid=\"zbfrsZx1\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"578482733\" href=\"#/post/578482733\">3A：认领语言家长</a></li><li data-pid=\"wId8zxwz\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"579111390\" href=\"#/post/579111390\">3A：新领域：真实对话</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-11\">B：学习写作</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"rHQ0-VMj\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"579995057\" href=\"#/post/579995057\">3B：激活语言</a></li><li data-pid=\"ryk2sUh9\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"580682047\" href=\"#/post/580682047\">3B：发音</a></li><li data-pid=\"jWUKIa04\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"584034158\" href=\"#/post/584034158\">3B：活动指南</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-12\">C：学习口语</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"AAT1RJ31\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"584490294\" href=\"#/post/584490294\">3C：能力与表现</a></li><li data-pid=\"i-BLnJtu\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"585570298\" href=\"#/post/585570298\">3C：常见语言能力弱项</a></li><li data-pid=\"5VCppCeq\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"585891018\" href=\"#/post/585891018\">3C：口语练习</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-13\">阶段 4：超越流利</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"TtoPvZ21\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"678842646\" href=\"#/post/678842646\">阶段 4：超越流利</a></li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><hr/><p data-pid=\"XXuZpDhA\">详细版：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-ad9fd00d617ba3c3b92524e9c77ef66b_qhd.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1400\" data-image-width=\"2160\" data-tm-id=\"671671625\" href=\"#/post/671671625\">Thoughts Memo：从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（详细版）</a><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"ULB_wdom\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/simplified/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Simple Roadmap | Refold</a></blockquote>","rec_chain":[{"id":"585891018","title":"3C：口语练习","author":"Refold","votes":36,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 外语习得"},{"id":"597275400","title":"为二语习得提供输入","author":"Stephen Krashen","votes":161,"minutes":40,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 外语习得"},{"id":"56359580